{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist-style flight shooter game where your mission is to pilot a spaceship deep underground and detonate a nuclear bomb at the planet's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.poster.avif?t=1771952457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.webm?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.mp4?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Absorb Modules, Enhance the Chassis</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four modules can be synthesized into different skills depending on their shapes. Synthesized skills can be adjusted based on the spaceship's configuration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/63111de0200fc3282bdb7a0202e26540.poster.avif?t=1771952457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/63111de0200fc3282bdb7a0202e26540.webm?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/63111de0200fc3282bdb7a0202e26540.mp4?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/6a38e524b54d1175436272acf45c3d66.poster.avif?t=1771952457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/6a38e524b54d1175436272acf45c3d66.webm?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/6a38e524b54d1175436272acf45c3d66.mp4?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adjust the Chassis, Upgrade Abilities</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sacrifice is valuable. The ores obtained during missions can be used to upgrade and modify the next spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.poster.avif?t=1771952457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.webm?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.mp4?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Bosses, Breakthrough Levels</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside each planet, there are bizarre Bosses defending their lairs. You must defeat the core Boss to destroy the entire planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.poster.avif?t=1771952457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.webm?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.mp4?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can snap them into any shape during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/82307eb94cbf5641b29bf46beee2438c.poster.avif?t=1771952457\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/82307eb94cbf5641b29bf46beee2438c.webm?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/82307eb94cbf5641b29bf46beee2438c.mp4?t=1771952457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942500?t=1771952457","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942500?t=1771952457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/029d8b0da615e061341ef0e01d4dbc2897e5a478/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771952457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/029d8b0da615e061341ef0e01d4dbc2897e5a478/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771952457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist-style flight shooter game where your mission is to pilot a spaceship deep underground and detonate a nuclear bomb at the planet's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s